The one-import barrel. Re-exposes every component constructor plus the whole shared attribute/event vocabulary, so `import Markup exposing (..)` gives you every constructor together with `disabled`/`variant`/`onClick`/… . Token values stay in `Markup.Token` (re-exposing hundreds here would bloat the namespace). Each constructor takes `[attributes] [content]`; reach for the per-component `Markup.<Component>` modules when you want the strict, component-scoped types.

